<p>While Highers are not meant to rule other humans - and show no particular will to do so - they are frequently called to higher duties.</p><p>Their nature grants them better senses than other humans.</p><p>Increase blindness immunity by <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">15%, 28%, 37%, 44%, 50%,</acronym> maximum sight range by <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">1, 2, 3, 4, 5,</acronym> and increases existing infravision, and heightened senses range by <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">1, 1, 2, 2, 3.</acronym></p><p>At talent level 5, each time you hit a target you gain telepathy to all similar creatures in radius 15 for 5 turns.</p>